  "body": "Hello\r\nthank you for your lib and your work!\r\n\r\nI use your lib to communicate with ledger Nano S.\r\ni have no problem to send basic command and receive the result directly.\r\n\r\nBut, in some case, a transaction should be approve on the ledger key by the user before receiving the result.\r\n1) js lib send an APDU (ex: c0e40000)\r\n2) a message appear on the ledger key (ex: would you approve the transaction ?)\r\n3) if yes, the ledger send the result to js lib. If not, blank is return\r\nIn this case, the lib don't wait the approval and the result. we get directly blank.\r\nHow can I use the webhid lib to waiting a response from the ledger.\r\n\r\nApparently, that's 'sendReport' is concerned.\r\n\r\nThx\r\n",
